  "body": "- North-facing with all-day sun\r\n- Floor area 134sqm including deck (more or less)\r\n- Top-floor position with a beautiful outlook\r\n- Three bedrooms with excellent separation\r\n- Two side-by-side car parks\r\n- Spacious open-plan living\r\n- Walk-in wardrobe and ensuite to the master\r\n\r\nPositioned on the top floor, this beautifully kept apartment offers a thoughtfully designed layout, with the master suite separated from the remaining two bedrooms for added privacy. Windows at both the front and rear create excellent airflow, while the north-facing aspect keeps the home warm in winter and comfortable through summer.\r\n\r\n- Generous storage throughout\r\n- Large, light-filled living area\r\n- Excellent indoor flow\r\n- Separate laundry area\r\n- Family bathroom with bathtub\r\n- Quiet and private position\r\n- Excellent visitor parking\r\n- Well maintained and tidy\r\n- Easy lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Long Bay living with Long Bay Village, cafes, shops and New World all within walking distance, while beautiful Long Bay Beach is just a five-minute walk away. Zoned for Long Bay College and Long Bay Primary School, this is an exceptional opportunity for families, professionals or those seeking an easy coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/HBT7",
